is:

         .     "widely-held;"
         .     "freely-transferable;" and
         .     either part of a class of securities registered under Section
               12(b) or 12(g) of the Securities Exchange Act of 1934, or sold in
               connection with an effective registration statement under the
               Securities Act, provided the securities are registered under the
               Exchange Act within 190 days after the end of the fiscal year of
               the issuer during which the offering occurred.

Our shares of common stock are being sold in connection with an effective
